Cell[TextData[{
 "1. Which diagrams depend on the external momentum?\n\nThere are two \
relevant ordinary two-loop 1PI two-point graphs in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox["\[Phi]", "4"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\phi^4$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "03835762-3e8b-a44d-a2ad-9c10340d965a"],
 " theory:\n\nSunset: one external leg attaches to each quartic vertex. The \
external momentum flows through the internal propagators.\nTadpole-insertion \
graph: both external legs attach to the same vertex. Their momenta cancel \
there, so the loop integral is independent of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["p", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$p$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "41d37797-fe3b-d74e-a660-89b228379724"],
 ".\n\nThe tadpole-insertion graph vanishes in massless DR because it \
contains scaleless integrals. It cannot contribute to the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$p^2$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ee37fc7f-d2c4-c548-a5f2-8d0933075f67"],
 " counterterm in any case, because it is momentum-independent.\n\nThus the \
sunset is the only ordinary two-loop graph relevant to the momentum-dependent \
correction.\n\n2. Sunset symmetry factor and Euclidean contribution\n\nWe can \
derive its symmetry factor directly from Wick contractions. At second order \
in the interaction, the expansion supplies\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         FractionBox["1", "2!"], 
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
            FractionBox["\[Lambda]", "4!"], ")"}], "2"], "."}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\frac{1}{2!}\\left(\\frac{\\lambda}{4!}\\right)^2.$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ea634410-a879-8c4e-9492-276e8b12fa35"],
 "\n\nFor the sunset contractions:\n\nThere are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["2", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$2$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "68a28ca4-5052-684f-856d-52df92572b0b"],
 " ways to assign the two labeled external fields to the two vertices.\nThere \
are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["4", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$4$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6d00e38d-41c7-db46-8a1f-8aeefda83336"],
 " choices for their attachment at each vertex.\nThere are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["3!", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$3!$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f474db2a-244f-0040-ae0d-7de78f389144"],
 " ways to connect the remaining three fields at one vertex to those at the \
other.\n\nTherefore,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         FractionBox[
          
          RowBox[{"2", "\[CenterDot]", "4", "\[CenterDot]", "4", 
            "\[CenterDot]", "3!"}], 
          RowBox[{"2!", 
            SuperscriptBox[
             RowBox[{"(", "4!", ")"}], "2"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox["1", "6"], "."}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\frac{2\\cdot4\\cdot4\\cdot3!}{2!(4!)^2}=\\frac16.$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "61f37e81-d640-6142-b702-ceae4cbdcaf6"],
 "\n\nThe second-order contribution to the connected Euclidean propagator is \
positive. Passing to the inverse propagator changes its sign: if\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["G", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["G", "TI"], "0"], "+", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["G", "TI"], "0"], 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["G", "TI"], "0"], "+", "\[CenterEllipsis]", ","}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$G=G_0+G_0 A G_0+\\cdots,$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3aae21d8-cab4-ac48-b9cc-2be64d10862d"],
 "\n\nthen\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["G", "TI"], "-1"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubsuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["G", "TI"], "0", "-1"], "-", 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"], "+", "\[CenterEllipsis]", "."}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$G^{-1}=G_0^{-1}-A+\\cdots.$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7c5fb7f4-c069-a542-a857-4631b57b610f"],
 "\n\nConsequently,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
           SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]\[CapitalGamma]", 
            StyleBox["sunset", FontSlant -> "Plain"], 
            RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
           FractionBox[
            SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], "6"], 
           StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], ",    ", 
           StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", 
            RowBox[{"2", "\[Epsilon]"}]], "\[Integral]", 
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{
              SuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["d", "TI"]], 
              StyleBox["k", "TI"], 
              SuperscriptBox["\[DifferentialD]", 
               StyleBox["d", "TI"]], "\[ScriptL]"}], 
            SuperscriptBox[
             RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"2", "\[Pi]"}], ")"}], 
             RowBox[{"2", 
               StyleBox["d", "TI"]}]]], 
           FractionBox["1", 
            RowBox[{
              SuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["k", "TI"], "2"], 
              SuperscriptBox["\[ScriptL]", "2"], 
              SuperscriptBox[
               RowBox[{"(", 
                 RowBox[{
                   StyleBox["p", "TI"], "-", 
                   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "-", "\[ScriptL]"}], ")"}], "2"]}]], 
           "."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "31"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ \\Delta\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{sunset}}^{(2)}(p) \
=-\\frac{\\lambda^2}{6}H(p), \\qquad H(p)=\\mu^{2\\epsilon} \
\\int\\frac{d^dk\\,d^d\\ell}{(2\\pi)^{2d}} \
\\frac{1}{k^2\\ell^2(p-k-\\ell)^2}. } \\tag{B-31}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "03e74752-633e-f64a-a60e-a4d7eab614b6"],
 "\n\nThe two powers of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", "\[Epsilon]"], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$\\mu^\\epsilon$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "de0eca2c-c8c4-2e4c-be9e-510642cdd83d"],
 " implement our convention of one such factor per loop.\n\n3. Massless \
one-loop convolution identity\n\nTo evaluate ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["H", "TI"], "(", 
         StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$H(p)$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "670b663c-0a3e-e142-ac02-bf1538c1fbc3"],
 ", define\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["J", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", ",", "\[Beta]"}]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["Q", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", "\[Integral]", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            SuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["d", "TI"]], 
            StyleBox["q", "TI"]}], 
          SuperscriptBox[
           RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{"2", "\[Pi]"}], ")"}], 
           StyleBox["d", "TI"]]], 
         FractionBox["1", 
          RowBox[{
            SuperscriptBox[
             RowBox[{"(", 
               SuperscriptBox[
                StyleBox["q", "TI"], "2"], ")"}], "\[Alpha]"], 
            SuperscriptBox[
