Cell["\<\
Question | Generate the two-loop 1PI two-point sunset diagram using FeynArts \
and FeynCalc, perform the Wick rotation to Euclidean space, set internal \
propagators to massless form with nonzero external momentum $p^2 > 0$, \
evaluate the sunset integral $H(p)$ via successive massless convolutions, and \
obtain its Laurent expansion through the finite term.

Derivation | FeynArts generates the two-loop self-energy topologies, and \
FCFAConvert extracts the sunset amplitude with symmetry factor $1/6$. \
Successive applications of the massless DR convolution identity yield the \
exact gamma-function representation B-34. Laurent expansion around $\\epsilon \
= 0$ extracts the pole coefficient $-p^2/(512\\pi^4\\epsilon)$ and the finite \
$\\epsilon^0$ term containing $\\ln(4\\pi\\mu^2/p^2)$, $\\gamma_E$, and \
$13/4$. Four-point subdivergences reduce to momentum-independent tadpoles \
that vanish in massless DR and do not alter the $p^2/\\epsilon$ pole.

Check | Mathematica script successfully executes both nested convolution \
steps via the DR scalar integral formula, reproduces the exact gamma-function \
expression B-34, and confirms via Series expansion that the pole and finite \
terms match the analytical Laurent expansion B-36.

Anchor IDs | B-31\[Dash]B-39.

Status | derived and Mathematica checked.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  4.0042861785417347`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"a48a8c9d-35ca-2544-91e8-\
4f6c38605189"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Subsection2.2:", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.004286186298126*^9, 
  4.0042861925268*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b10c17d9-8597-2840-b173-73547b0f8483"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We continue from B-39, using\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["d", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "4", "-", "\[Epsilon]", ",    ", 
         StyleBox["g", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox["\[Lambda]", 
          RowBox[{"16", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[Pi]", "2"]}]], ","}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$d=4-\\epsilon,\\qquad g=\\frac{\\lambda}{16\\pi^2},$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b6060697-dbc2-b24c-a94b-85c1b0cd4e51"],
 "\n\nmassless Euclidean DR at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], ">", "0"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$p^2>0$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c6e68a74-6873-0b42-9038-4c375f27126e"],
 ", and minimal subtraction without an ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       OverscriptBox[
        StyleBox["MS", FontSlant -> "Plain"], "_"], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$\\overline{\\mathrm{MS}}$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bfe21761-6044-a54d-995a-3fa0d9f5ed3b"],
 " scale redefinition.\n\nOur task is to extract ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$Z_\\phi$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f8ce4e1a-0270-164c-b94c-a9a33278e986"],
 " from the sunset pole, derive ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "\[Phi]"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\gamma_\\phi$ and $\\eta$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "df8360db-bd7c-0c4c-8206-071c7c584717"],
 ", and independently check their signs and coefficients against the finite \
momentum logarithm.\n\n1. Sunset contribution to the inverse propagator\n\n\
From subsection 2.1,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
         FractionBox[
          SuperscriptBox[
           StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], 
          RowBox[{"2", 
            SuperscriptBox[
             RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"16", 
                 SuperscriptBox["\[Pi]", "2"]}], ")"}], "2"]}]], 
         RowBox[{"[", 
           RowBox[{
             FractionBox["1", "\[Epsilon]"], "+", "ln", 
             FractionBox[
              RowBox[{"4", 
                SuperscriptBox["\[Pi]\[Mu]", "2"]}], 
              SuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"]], "+", 
             FractionBox["13", "4"], "-", 
             SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
              StyleBox["E", "TI"]]}], "]"}], "+", 
         StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", "\[Epsilon]", ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$H(p)= -\\frac{p^2}{2(16\\pi^2)^2} \\left[ \
\\frac1\\epsilon+\\ln\\frac{4\\pi\\mu^2}{p^2} +\\frac{13}{4}-\\gamma_E \
\\right]+O(\\epsilon).$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7962d078-9738-8545-95a8-803156bd4d13"],
 "\n\nRecall why the sunset enters the inverse propagator with a minus sign. \
Its second-order contribution to the connected propagator is\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["sunset", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["G", "TI"], "0"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], " ", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], 
            StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
            RowBox[{"(", 
              StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}]}], "6"], " ", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["G", "TI"], "0"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\Delta G_{\\mathrm{sunset}}(p) \
=G_0(p)\\,\\frac{\\lambda^2H(p)}6\\,G_0(p).$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c2ace7b8-5b65-8947-b4b8-81053c28e0c7"],
 "\n\nExpanding the inverse,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{
              SubscriptBox[
               StyleBox["G", "TI"], "0"], "+", "\[CapitalDelta]", 
              StyleBox["G", "TI"]}], ")"}], "-1"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubsuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["G", "TI"], "0", "-1"], "-", 
         SubsuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["G", "TI"], "0", "-1"], "\[CapitalDelta]", 
         StyleBox["G", "TI"], " ", 
         SubsuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["G", "TI"], "0", "-1"], "+", "\[CenterEllipsis]", ","}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$(G_0+\\Delta G)^{-1} =G_0^{-1}-G_0^{-1}\\Delta G\\,G_0^{-1}+\\cdots,$",
      "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6f56ec9d-a9b0-004e-a1a4-46c8c1649b89"],
 "\n\ngives ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox["sunset", FontSlant -> "Plain"], 
          RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], 
         StyleBox["H", "TI"], "/", "6"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\Delta\\Gamma^{(2)}_{\\mathrm{sunset}}=-\\lambda^2H/6$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "54b559e0-c28c-3a45-91a2-5fa9f4e8f3e8"],
 ".\n\nThus the negative pole in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["H", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$H$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "34d64df2-7505-954b-a494-a73449aecce5"],
 " produces a positive pole in the inverse propagator:\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
           SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]\[CapitalGamma]", 
            StyleBox["sunset", FontSlant -> "Plain"], 
            RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{
              SuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], 
              SuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"]}], "12"], 
           RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{
               FractionBox["1", "\[Epsilon]"], "-", "ln", 
               FractionBox[
                SuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], 
                SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", "2"]], "+", 
               SubscriptBox[
                StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
                StyleBox["MS", FontSlant -> "Plain"]]}], "]"}], "+", 
           StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{
               SuperscriptBox[
                StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], "\[Epsilon]"}], ")"}], ",    ", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["MS", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", "ln", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{"4", "\[Pi]"}], ")"}], "+", 
           FractionBox["13", "4"], "-", 
           SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", 
            StyleBox["E", "TI"]], "."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "40"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ \\Delta\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{sunset}}^{(2)}(p) = \
\\frac{g^2p^2}{12} \\left[ \\frac1\\epsilon -\\ln\\frac{p^2}{\\mu^2} \
+C_{\\mathrm{MS}} \\right] +O(g^2\\epsilon), \\qquad \
C_{\\mathrm{MS}}=\\ln(4\\pi)+\\frac{13}{4}-\\gamma_E. } \\tag{B-40}$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "be949e82-a3b6-a14d-9b71-2c89dd120a93"],
 "\n\nThis restates B-38 in a form that makes the momentum logarithm \
explicit.\n\nThe other two-loop graph and the four-point counterterm \
insertions discussed in subsection 2.1 do not contribute to the $p^2$ pole.\n\
\n2. Extracting the field renormalization constant\n\nDefine the renormalized \
field by\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[Phi]", "0"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubsuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]", 
          RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]], "\[Phi]", "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$\\phi_0=Z_\\phi^{1/2}\\phi.$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "540a3c08-8979-2f4c-af13-136e20bdc8f0"],
 "\n\nThe bare kinetic term then becomes\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         FractionBox["1", "2"], 
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
              SubscriptBox["\[Phi]", "0"]}], ")"}], "2"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox["1", "2"], 
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", "\[Phi]"}], ")"}], "2"], "+", 
         FractionBox["1", "2"], "\[Delta]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], 
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", "\[Phi]"}], ")"}], "2"], ",    ", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], "\[LongEqual]", "1", "+", 
         "\[Delta]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\frac12(\\partial\\phi_0)^2 =\\frac12(\\partial\\phi)^2 \
+\\frac12\\delta Z_\\phi(\\partial\\phi)^2, \\qquad Z_\\phi=1+\\delta \
Z_\\phi.$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "90c97f53-3e04-9646-b649-5b194e23931d"],
 "\n\nConsequently, the kinetic counterterm contributes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"+", "\[Delta]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$+\\delta Z_\\phi p^2$ to $\\Gamma^{(2)}$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "59a2ba3e-ae82-254e-a20d-0e5f5118eee6"],
 ".\n\nAt order ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$g^2$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "903ca391-b9d7-dd42-adc6-acc0b2488d9a"],
 ", cancellation of the pole requires\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Delta]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], "+", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            SuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], 
            SuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"]}], 
          RowBox[{"12", "\[Epsilon]"}]], "\[LongEqual]", "0."}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\delta Z_\\phi p^2+\\frac{g^2p^2}{12\\epsilon}=0.$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "70109823-22c6-2c43-8ff4-8beb93f6cf70"],
 "\n\nTherefore,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\[Delta]", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["Z", "TI"], 
            RowBox[{"\[Phi]", ",", 
              StyleBox["MS", FontSlant -> "Plain"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
           FractionBox[
            SuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], 
            RowBox[{"12", "\[Epsilon]"}]], "+", 
           StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["g", "TI"], "3"], ")"}], ",    ", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], "\[LongEqual]", "1", "-", 
           FractionBox[
            SuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], 
            RowBox[{"12", "\[Epsilon]"}]], "+", 
           StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["g", "TI"], "3"], ")"}], "."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "41"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ \\delta Z_{\\phi,\\mathrm{MS}} \
=-\\frac{g^2}{12\\epsilon}+O(g^3), \\qquad \
Z_\\phi=1-\\frac{g^2}{12\\epsilon}+O(g^3). } \\tag{B-41}$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "eca28173-be67-a84c-9852-c72af0bd23b7"],
 "\n\nHere ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["O", "TI"], "(", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], "3"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$O(g^3)$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c383ea79-8dfe-1241-8c88-249c131421f4"],
 " denotes higher-order terms in the renormalization constant, which may \
themselves contain poles.\n\nAfter subtracting the pole, the renormalized \
inverse propagator is\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
           SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
            StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
            RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
           SuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], 
           RowBox[{"[", 
             RowBox[{"1", "+", 
               FractionBox[
                SuperscriptBox[
                 StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], "12"], 
               RowBox[{"(", 
                 RowBox[{
                   SubscriptBox[
                    StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
                    StyleBox["MS", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "-", "ln", 
                   FractionBox[
                    SuperscriptBox[
                    StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], 
                    SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", "2"]]}], ")"}]}], "]"}], "+", 
           StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["g", "TI"], "3"], ")"}], "."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "42"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ \\Gamma_R^{(2)}(p) = p^2\\left[ 1+\\frac{g^2}{12} \\left( C_{\
\\mathrm{MS}}-\\ln\\frac{p^2}{\\mu^2} \\right) \\right] +O(g^3). } \
\\tag{B-42}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "35a62bb5-1126-b543-9ece-5c698a198095"],
 "\n\nThe finite constant remains because MS removes poles only.\n\n3. \
Deriving the anomalous dimension\n\nThe project defines\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "\[Phi]"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["g", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox["1", "2"], 
         SubscriptBox[
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\[Mu]", 
              FractionBox[
               StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
               RowBox[{
                 StyleBox["d", "TI"], "\[Mu]"}]], "ln", 
              SubscriptBox[
               StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"]}], "\[VerticalSeparator]"}], 
          StyleBox["bare", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\gamma_\\phi(g) =\\frac12 \\left.\\mu\\frac{d}{d\\mu}\\ln \
Z_\\phi\\right|_{\\mathrm{bare}}.$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3e797c7f-7f5a-ec4f-960f-e968a5e0d982"],
 "\n\nIn MS, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$Z_\\phi$ depends on $\\mu$ through $g(\\mu)$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7abe505b-1a51-d54a-8b19-9ae760a51b3b"],
 ", so\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "\[Phi]"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["g", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox["1", "2"], 
         SubscriptBox["\[Beta]", 
          StyleBox["g", "TI"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["g", "TI"], ")"}], 
         FractionBox["\[PartialD]", 
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
            StyleBox["g", "TI"]}]], "ln", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\gamma_\\phi(g) =\\frac12\\beta_g(g)\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \
g}\\ln Z_\\phi.$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1d8bcd37-daf9-7d49-80cf-7ea2a83e17cd"],
 "\n\nFrom B-41,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"ln", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
         FractionBox[
          SuperscriptBox[
           StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], 
          RowBox[{"12", "\[Epsilon]"}]], "+", 
         StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["g", "TI"], "3"], ")"}], ",    ", 
         FractionBox["\[PartialD]", 
          RowBox[{"\[PartialD]", 
            StyleBox["g", "TI"]}]], "ln", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
         FractionBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"6", "\[Epsilon]"}]], "+", 
         StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\ln Z_\\phi=-\\frac{g^2}{12\\epsilon}+O(g^3), \\qquad \
\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial g}\\ln Z_\\phi =-\\frac{g}{6\\epsilon}+O(g^2).$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d59deb87-05ae-8942-a4da-2a14e2c5784e"],
 "\n\nUsing the beta function from Part 1,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[Beta]", 
          StyleBox["g", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", "-", "\[Epsilon]", 
         StyleBox["g", "TI"], "+", "3", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], "+", 
         StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["g", "TI"], "3"], ")"}], ","}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$\\beta_g=-\\epsilon g+3g^2+O(g^3),$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "df35223c-f3cb-7b48-959f-c853d997b7fa"],
 "\n\nwe obtain, through order ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$g^2$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "792f9b69-d132-744f-89b0-41fb419e9dda"],
 ",\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "\[Phi]"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["g", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox["1", "2"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"-", "\[Epsilon]", 
             StyleBox["g", "TI"]}], ")"}], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"-", 
             FractionBox[
              StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
              RowBox[{"6", "\[Epsilon]"}]]}], ")"}], "+", 
         StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["g", "TI"], "3"], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\gamma_\\phi(g) =\\frac12(-\\epsilon g) \\left(-\\frac{g}{6\\epsilon}\
\\right)+O(g^3).$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7de58a2c-e56d-4042-acca-95dea537e304"],
 "\n\nHence\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "\[Phi]"], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             StyleBox["g", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
           FractionBox[
            SuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], "12"], "+", 
           StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["g", "TI"], "3"], ")"}], "."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "43"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ \\gamma_\\phi(g)=\\frac{g^2}{12}+O(g^3). } \\tag{B-43}$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b9d4e867-3f08-c14c-99cb-371827e6dfb3"],
 "\n\nThe engineering term ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"-", "\[Epsilon]", 
         StyleBox["g", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$-\\epsilon g$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "fa17684a-b819-a245-a6f1-86e3eb2bc7c3"],
 " is essential: it multiplies the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"1", "/", "\[Epsilon]"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$1/\\epsilon$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "51f50e89-50a5-574c-8703-1831cfe2b765"],
 " pole in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$Z_\\phi$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "196dba97-f556-5c47-aff3-95ec615013ce"],
 " to give a finite result. We must not set ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Epsilon]", "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$\\epsilon=0$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e5bbfd24-681c-f541-aed6-58deb27d11ec"],
 " before differentiating.\n\nAlso, using the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"3", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$3g^2$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "53c0aafb-f6ad-0645-881e-2026fa3798be"],
 " term here generates an order-",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["g", "TI"], "3"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$g^3$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2ed832cf-e6b9-7e41-8356-228198a96347"],
 " expression. At that order, higher-order terms in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$Z_\\phi$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "eea16313-2323-0c41-91d7-93348f097999"],
 " are required; the two-loop result alone must not be used to infer a \
leftover divergence.\n\n4. Critical exponent ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Eta]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\eta$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "917fc77d-976a-4549-9056-08564b14c96b"],
 "\n\nAt the Wilson\[Dash]Fisher fixed point,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], "*"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], "+", 
         StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$g_*=\\frac{\\epsilon}{3}+O(\\epsilon^2).$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f361a4be-c4a2-6740-86f0-6d6204a88ffb"],
 "\n\nThe field exponent is\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "\[LongEqual]", "2", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "\[Phi]"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["g", "TI"], "*"], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$\\eta=2\\gamma_\\phi(g_*).$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b2b14ba6-db6f-1d41-b99f-c376d7cf3f80"],
 "\n\nSubstituting B-43 gives\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox[
          SubsuperscriptBox[
           StyleBox["g", "TI"], "*", "2"], "6"], "+", 
         StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SubsuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["g", "TI"], "*", "3"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox["1", "6"], 
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
            FractionBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], ")"}], "2"], "+", 
         StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\eta =\\frac{g_*^2}{6}+O(g_*^3) \
=\\frac16\\left(\\frac{\\epsilon}{3}\\right)^2+O(\\epsilon^3).$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d46f5197-e7eb-004c-bad3-33dfc0cb542e"],
 "\n\nTherefore,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "\[LongEqual]", 
           FractionBox[
            SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], "54"], "+", 
           StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], ")"}], ",    ", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["crit", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], "\[Proportional]", 
           SuperscriptBox[
            RowBox[{"(", 
              SuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], ")"}], 
            RowBox[{"-1", "+", 
              SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], "/", "108", "+", 
              StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
              RowBox[{"(", 
                SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], ")"}]}]], "."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "44"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ \\eta=\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{54}+O(\\epsilon^3), \\qquad \
G_{\\mathrm{crit}}(p)\\propto (p^2)^{-1+\\epsilon^2/108+O(\\epsilon^3)}. } \
\\tag{B-44}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1f36b4cb-832e-df4d-bf83-973c0ff0b033"],
 "\nWhy does the one-loop fixed point suffice?\n\nSuppose its next correction \
is\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], "*"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], "+", 
         StyleBox["c", "TI"], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], "+", 
         StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$g_*=\\frac{\\epsilon}{3}+c\\,\\epsilon^2+O(\\epsilon^3).$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3b52f947-d2d5-5d4b-a05f-03b09b208c7f"],
 "\n\nThen\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubsuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], "*", "2"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox[
          SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], "9"], "+", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{"2", 
            StyleBox["c", "TI"]}], "3"], 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], "+", 
         StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "4"], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$g_*^2 =\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{9}+\\frac{2c}{3}\\epsilon^3+O(\\epsilon^4).$\
", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6fae3d29-1223-f940-af5f-21fed71a2ee7"],
 "\n\nThus the unknown correction to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["g", "TI"], "*"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$g_*$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c7f69205-7ec5-a448-889a-3069762213c3"],
 " first affects ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Eta]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\eta$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "951635b2-3c84-2347-b129-1acca73e0348"],
 " at order ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\epsilon^3$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e5394993-b62c-6343-b0b1-b3cd74c0e196"],
 ". Likewise, the unknown ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["O", "TI"], "(", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["g", "TI"], "3"], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$O(g^3)$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d04df4ca-8191-6341-baf5-844a39742f84"],
 " term in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "\[Phi]"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\gamma_\\phi$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e96341f4-1fec-e141-a444-7cb4773b7597"],
 " first contributes at order ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\epsilon^3$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c7b0db3d-5127-f14e-b177-e5b0f8e79c5c"],
 ".\n\nThe leading ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["g", "TI"], "2"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$g^2$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "13b8a66d-0d13-1c4d-9d5d-336896e65f22"],
 " anomalous dimension and the one-loop fixed point therefore determine ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Eta]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\eta$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "fa7427e1-a1f4-294c-87af-85f6d872a001"],
 " completely through order ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\epsilon^2$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "717f7ef1-800f-4c47-b10c-45148cb1fef0"],
 ".\n\n5. Check using the finite momentum logarithm\n\nWe can check the \
result independently using B-42, without differentiating ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Phi]"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$Z_\\phi$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b9bf4c36-d851-1e4d-984c-ed480f97eddb"],
 ".\n\nAt the fixed point, normalize the inverse propagator at the reference \
momentum ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", "2"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$p^2=\\mu^2$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5e8a66df-2bb4-bc47-9078-5a597eb2f5a7"],
 ". Taking the ratio cancels the momentum-independent finite constant:\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
             RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]], "(", 
            StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], 
          RowBox[{
            SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
             RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]], 
            RowBox[{"(", 
              StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], 
            SubscriptBox["|", 
             RowBox[{
               SuperscriptBox[
                StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], "\[LongEqual]", 
               SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", "2"]}]]}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox[
          SuperscriptBox[
           StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", "2"]], 
         RowBox[{"[", 
           RowBox[{"1", "-", 
             FractionBox[
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["g", "TI"], "*", "2"], "12"], "ln", 
             FractionBox[
              SuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], 
              SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", "2"]], "+", 
             StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
             RowBox[{"(", 
               SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], ")"}]}], "]"}], "."}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\frac{\\Gamma_R^{(2)}(p)}{\\Gamma_R^{(2)}(p)\\big|_{p^2=\\mu^2}} = \
\\frac{p^2}{\\mu^2} \\left[ 1-\\frac{g_*^2}{12}\\ln\\frac{p^2}{\\mu^2} \
+O(\\epsilon^3) \\right].$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7c994dd9-ee31-6c46-9514-678c2e8b99c9"],
 "\n\nOn the other hand, critical scaling requires\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"(", "2", ")"}]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], "\[Proportional]", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
            SuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], ")"}], 
          RowBox[{"1", "-", "\[Eta]", "/", "2"}]], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\Gamma_R^{(2)}(p)\\propto(p^2)^{1-\\eta/2}.$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d0391a2d-9ba0-0b44-a189-9b90c1e998ea"],
 "\n\nExpanding the corresponding normalized power law,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
            FractionBox[
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], 
             SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", "2"]], ")"}], 
          RowBox[{"1", "-", "\[Eta]", "/", "2"}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox[
          SuperscriptBox[
           StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], 
          SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", "2"]], 
         RowBox[{"[", 
           RowBox[{"1", "-", 
             FractionBox["\[Eta]", "2"], "ln", 
             FractionBox[
              SuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], 
              SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", "2"]], "+", 
             StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
             RowBox[{"(", 
               SuperscriptBox["\[Eta]", "2"], ")"}]}], "]"}], "."}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\left(\\frac{p^2}{\\mu^2}\\right)^{1-\\eta/2} = \\frac{p^2}{\\mu^2} \
\\left[ 1-\\frac{\\eta}{2}\\ln\\frac{p^2}{\\mu^2} +O(\\eta^2) \\right].$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e57d4814-a2c7-3d4d-a043-54742079c04e"],
 "\n\nMatching logarithmic coefficients gives\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", 
           FractionBox["\[Eta]", "2"], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
           FractionBox[
            SubsuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["g", "TI"], "*", "2"], "12"], ",    ", "\[Eta]", 
           "\[LongEqual]", 
           FractionBox[
            SubsuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["g", "TI"], "*", "2"], "6"], "\[LongEqual]", 
           FractionBox[
            SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], "54"], "+", 
           StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], ")"}], "."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "45"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ -\\frac{\\eta}{2}=-\\frac{g_*^2}{12}, \\qquad \
\\eta=\\frac{g_*^2}{6} =\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{54}+O(\\epsilon^3). } \
\\tag{B-45}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "09c0d07a-f61f-8646-867c-def1596e4d9a"],
 "\n\nThis confirms both the positive sign of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Eta]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\eta$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "dcf51965-2548-474e-a0a0-0af123bad0c0"],
 " and its coefficient. In particular, the negative logarithm in the inverse \
propagator becomes a positive logarithm in the propagator:\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["R", "TI"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox["1", 
          SuperscriptBox[
           StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"]], 
         RowBox[{"[", 
           RowBox[{"1", "+", 
             FractionBox[
              SubsuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["g", "TI"], "*", "2"], "12"], "ln", 
             FractionBox[
              SuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], 
              SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", "2"]], "+", 
             "momentum\[Hyphen]independent terms", "+", "\[CenterEllipsis]"}],
            "]"}], ","}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$G_R(p)=\\frac1{p^2} \\left[ 1+\\frac{g_*^2}{12}\\ln\\frac{p^2}{\\mu^2} \
+\\text{momentum-independent terms}+\\cdots \\right],$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "091127f2-176d-7544-b8cf-6c914b0eed5a"],
 "\n\nconsistent with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["crit", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], "\[Proportional]", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
            SuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], ")"}], 
          RowBox[{"-1", "+", "\[Eta]", "/", "2"}]]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$G_{\\mathrm{crit}}(p)\\propto(p^2)^{-1+\\eta/2}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "be48ddaa-d4a2-474e-b91a-a13a71e54293"],
 ".\nThe code below confirms our derivations:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0042881469009438`*^9, 4.0042885448516006`*^9}, 
   4.0042889254911633`*^9, {4.004289072902479*^9, 
   4.0042890827645283`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"69956923-6533-084f-b67c-\
2f284655e1d3"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Subsection", " ", "2.2"}], ":", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"checks", " ", "of", " ", "B"}], "-", 
     RowBox[{"40", " ", "through", " ", "B"}], "-", "45"}]}], "*)"}], 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "g", ",", "eps", ",", "p2", ",", "mu", ",", "x", ",", "c", ",", "cStar", 
      ",", "beta", ",", "h", ",", "sunset", ",", "zAnsatz", ",", "zRule", ",",
       "zPhi", ",", "gammaR", ",", "gammaPhi", ",", "gStar", ",", "eta", ",", 
      "etaCorrected", ",", "inverseShape", ",", "normalizedInverse", ",", 
      "normalizedPropagator", ",", "scalingInverse", ",", "scalingPropagator",
       ",", "checks"}], "}"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"(*", 
     RowBox[{
     "Previously", " ", "checked", " ", "sunset", " ", "Laurent", " ", 
      "expansion"}], "*)"}], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"h", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "p2"}], "/", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"2", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"16", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Pi", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}], "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}], "*", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"1", "/", "eps"}], "+", 
         RowBox[{"Log", "[", 
          RowBox[{"4", " ", "Pi", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"mu", "^", "2"}], "/", "p2"}]}], "]"}], "+", 
         RowBox[{"13", "/", "4"}], "-", "EulerGamma"}], ")"}]}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"B", "-", "40"}], ":", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
        "multiply", " ", "by", " ", "the", " ", "Euclidean", " ", "factor"}], 
        "-", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"lambda", "^", "2"}], "/", "6"}]}]}], "*)"}], 
     RowBox[{"sunset", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Expand", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"16", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Pi", "^", "2"}], " ", "g"}], ")"}], "^", "2"}]}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"h", "/", "6"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"B", "-", "41"}], ":", 
       RowBox[{
       "determine", " ", "delta", " ", "Z_phi", " ", "by", " ", 
        "cancellation", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "pole"}]}], "*)"}], 
     RowBox[{"zAnsatz", "=", 
      RowBox[{"c", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"g", "^", "2"}], "/", "eps"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"zRule", "=", 
      RowBox[{"First", "@", 
       RowBox[{"Solve", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Coefficient", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Expand", "[", 
             RowBox[{"sunset", "+", 
              RowBox[{"zAnsatz", " ", "p2"}]}], "]"}], ",", "eps", ",", 
            RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", "c"}], "]"}]}]}], ";",
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"zPhi", "=", 
      RowBox[{"1", "+", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"zAnsatz", "/.", " ", "zRule"}], ")"}]}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"B", "-", "42"}], ":", 
       RowBox[{"subtract", " ", "the", " ", "pole"}]}], "*)"}], 
     RowBox[{"gammaR", "=", 
      RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"p2", "+", "sunset", "+", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"zPhi", "-", "1"}], ")"}], " ", "p2"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Assumptions", "->", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"p2", ">", "0"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"mu", ">", "0"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"B", "-", "43"}], ":", 
        RowBox[{"fixed", "-", 
         RowBox[{"bare", " ", 
          RowBox[{"derivative", ".", "Expand"}], " ", "in", " ", "g", " ", 
          "BEFORE", " ", "taking", " ", "eps"}]}]}], "->", "0."}], "*)"}], 
     RowBox[{"beta", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "eps"}], " ", "g"}], "+", 
       RowBox[{"3", " ", 
        RowBox[{"g", "^", "2"}]}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"gammaPhi", "=", 
      RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Normal", "@", 
        RowBox[{"Series", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"beta", "/", "2"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"D", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Log", "[", "zPhi", "]"}], ",", "g"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"g", ",", "0", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"B", "-", "44"}], ":", 
       RowBox[{"fixed", "-", 
        RowBox[{"point", " ", "anomalous", " ", "exponent"}]}]}], "*)"}], 
     RowBox[{"gStar", "=", 
      RowBox[{"eps", "/", "3"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"eta", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Expand", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"2", " ", "gammaPhi"}], "/.", " ", 
        RowBox[{"g", "->", "gStar"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", 
      RowBox[{"Check", " ", "that", " ", "an", " ", "unknown", " ", "O", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"eps", "^", "2"}], ")"}], " ", "correction", " ", "to", " ", 
       "gStar", " ", "does", " ", "not", " ", "affect", " ", "eta", " ", 
       "through", " ", 
       RowBox[{"eps", "^", "2"}]}], "*)"}], 
     RowBox[{"etaCorrected", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Normal", "@", 
       RowBox[{"Series", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"2", " ", "gammaPhi"}], "/.", " ", 
          RowBox[{"g", "->", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"eps", "/", "3"}], "+", 
            RowBox[{"cStar", " ", 
             RowBox[{"eps", "^", "2"}]}]}]}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"eps", ",", "0", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"B", "-", "45"}], ":", 
        RowBox[{"normalized", " ", "inverse", " ", "propagator", " ", "and", " ", 
         RowBox[{"propagator", ".", "x"}]}]}], "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"p", "^", "2"}], "/", 
          RowBox[{"mu", "^", "2."}]}], " ", "Normalize", " ", "at", " ", 
         "x"}], "=", 
        RowBox[{"1", " ", "to", " ", "remove", " ", 
         RowBox[{"constants", "."}]}]}]}], "*)"}], 
     RowBox[{"inverseShape", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"gammaR", "/", "p2"}], "/.", " ", 
         RowBox[{"p2", "->", 
          RowBox[{"x", " ", 
           RowBox[{"mu", "^", "2"}]}]}]}], ")"}], "//", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
         RowBox[{"#", ",", 
          RowBox[{"Assumptions", "->", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"x", ">", "0"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"mu", ">", "0"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}], "&"}]}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"normalizedInverse", "=", 
      RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Normal", "@", 
         RowBox[{"Series", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"x", " ", 
            RowBox[{"inverseShape", "/", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"inverseShape", "/.", " ", 
               RowBox[{"x", "->", "1"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"g", ",", "0", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Assumptions", "->", 
         RowBox[{"x", ">", "0"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"normalizedPropagator", "=", 
      RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Normal", "@", 
         RowBox[{"Series", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"1", "/", "normalizedInverse"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"g", ",", "0", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Assumptions", "->", 
         RowBox[{"x", ">", "0"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Scaling", " ", "predictions", " ", "with", " ", "eta", 
        RowBox[{"(", "g", ")"}]}], "=", 
       RowBox[{"2", " ", "gammaPhi", 
        RowBox[{"(", "g", ")"}]}]}], "*)"}], 
     RowBox[{"scalingInverse", "=", 
      RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Normal", "@", 
         RowBox[{"Series", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"x", "^", 
            RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{"1", "-", "gammaPhi"}], ")"}]}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"g", ",", "0", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Assumptions", "->", 
         RowBox[{"x", ">", "0"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"scalingPropagator", "=", 
      RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Normal", "@", 
         RowBox[{"Series", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"x", "^", 
            RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", "1"}], "+", "gammaPhi"}], ")"}]}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"g", ",", "0", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Assumptions", "->", 
         RowBox[{"x", ">", "0"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"checks", "=", 
      RowBox[{"<|", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\"\<B-40: inverse-propagator pole\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Coefficient", "[", 
            RowBox[{"sunset", ",", "eps", ",", 
             RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}], "==", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"g", "^", "2"}], " ", 
            RowBox[{"p2", "/", "12"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<B-41: pole cancellation\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Coefficient", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Expand", "[", 
              RowBox[{"sunset", "+", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"(", 
                 RowBox[{"zPhi", "-", "1"}], ")"}], " ", "p2"}]}], "]"}], ",",
              "eps", ",", 
             RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}], "==", "0"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<B-43: anomalous dimension\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
          RowBox[{"gammaPhi", "==", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"g", "^", "2"}], "/", "12"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<B-44: eta\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
          RowBox[{"eta", "==", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"eps", "^", "2"}], "/", "54"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<One-loop fixed point suffices\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
          RowBox[{"etaCorrected", "==", "eta"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<B-45: inverse-propagator logarithm\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"normalizedInverse", "==", "scalingInverse"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"Assumptions", "->", 
            RowBox[{"x", ">", "0"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<B-45: propagator logarithm\>\"", "->", 
         RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"normalizedPropagator", "==", "scalingPropagator"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"Assumptions", "->", 
            RowBox[{"x", ">", "0"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], "|>"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"<|", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\"\<Z_phi\>\"", "->", "zPhi"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Gamma_R^(2)\>\"", "->", "gammaR"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<gamma_phi\>\"", "->", "gammaPhi"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<eta\>\"", "->", "eta"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Normalized inverse propagator\>\"", "->", 
        "normalizedInverse"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Normalized propagator\>\"", "->", 
        "normalizedPropagator"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Checks\>\"", "->", "checks"}]}], "|>"}]}]}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.004288738341776*^9, 4.004288738341776*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[118]:=",ExpressionUUID->"a3ba720d-1fb2-c24f-84ba-7023ebf427e5"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\<\"Z_phi\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"1", "-", 
      FractionBox[
       SuperscriptBox["g$17731", "2"], 
       RowBox[{"12", " ", "eps$17731"}]]}]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"Gamma_R^(2)\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "48"], " ", "p2$17731", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"4", " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["g$17731", "2"], " ", 
         RowBox[{"log", "(", 
          FractionBox[
           RowBox[{"4", " ", "\[Pi]", " ", 
            SuperscriptBox["mu$17731", "2"]}], "p2$17731"], ")"}]}], "+", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"13", "-", 
           RowBox[{"4", " ", 
            TagBox["\[DoubledGamma]",
             Function[{}, EulerGamma]]}]}], ")"}], " ", 
         SuperscriptBox["g$17731", "2"]}], "+", "48"}], ")"}]}]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"gamma_phi\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
     FractionBox[
      SuperscriptBox["g$17731", "2"], "12"]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"eta\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
     FractionBox[
      SuperscriptBox["eps$17731", "2"], "54"]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"Normalized inverse propagator\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"x$17731", "-", 
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox["1", "12"], " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["g$17731", "2"], " ", "x$17731", " ", 
       RowBox[{"log", "(", "x$17731", ")"}]}]}]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"Normalized propagator\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
     FractionBox[
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox["g$17731", "2"], " ", 
        RowBox[{"log", "(", "x$17731", ")"}]}], "+", "12"}], 
      RowBox[{"12", " ", "x$17731"}]]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"Checks\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\<\"B-40: inverse-propagator pole\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\<\"B-41: pole cancellation\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\<\"B-43: anomalous dimension\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\<\"B-44: eta\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\<\"One-loop fixed point suffices\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\<\"B-45: inverse-propagator logarithm\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
        "True"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\<\"B-45: propagator logarithm\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}]}], 
      "\[RightAssociation]"}]}]}], "\[RightAssociation]"}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.004288739154978*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[118]=",ExpressionUUID->"c1e9abdc-368a-c340-b426-827f03a300fc"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Question | Determine the sunset contribution to the Euclidean inverse \
propagator, extract the MS field renormalization constant, derive the field \
anomalous dimension and $\\eta$, and check the result using the finite \
momentum logarithm. Explain why the one-loop fixed point suffices through \
order $\\epsilon^2$.

Derivation | The sunset contributes the positive pole $g^2p^2/(12\\epsilon)$, \
requiring $Z_\\phi=1-g^2/(12\\epsilon)+O(g^3)$. Differentiation at fixed bare \
parameters gives $\\gamma_\\phi(g)=g^2/12+O(g^3)$, and evaluation at \
$g_*=\\epsilon/3+O(\\epsilon^2)$ yields \
$\\eta=\\epsilon^2/54+O(\\epsilon^3)$. The finite inverse-propagator term \
$-g^2p^2\\ln(p^2/\\mu^2)/12$ reproduces the same exponent. Corrections to the \
one-loop fixed point first affect $\\eta$ at order $\\epsilon^3$.

Check | User-reported Mathematica output confirms the sunset pole \
coefficient, counterterm cancellation, fixed-bare anomalous dimension, \
fixed-point exponent, and agreement of the normalized propagator and \
inverse-propagator logarithms with critical scaling. All seven checks return \
True. These checks use the previously established sunset integral and the \
analytically derived Euclidean prefactor $-\\lambda^2/6$; they do not \
independently verify that diagrammatic sign.

Anchor IDs | B-40\[Dash]B-45.

Status | derived and Mathematica checked.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  4.004289330811281*^9},ExpressionUUID->"dcc0e076-f9f0-764d-840f-\
d3c9e6c48ae8"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Subsection 2.3:", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.004289367111788*^9, 
  4.004289371230137*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8f596934-3b98-b141-aeea-\
8d23193e205c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We continue from B-45, using\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["d", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "4", "-", "\[Epsilon]", ",    ",
          "\[Eta]", "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox[
          SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], "54"], "+", 
         StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$d=4-\\epsilon, \\qquad \\eta=\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{54}+O(\\epsilon^3).$",
      "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "112dabf0-435b-9542-aa60-2c98667e9a65"],
 "\n\nThe essential step is to use the full scaling dimension of the field, \
including its anomalous part.\n\n1. Scaling dimensions of the field and its \
source\n\nAt criticality, the position-space two-point function behaves as\n\n\
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", 
           RowBox[{"\[Phi]", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
               StyleBox["x", "TI"], ")"}], "\[Phi]", 
             RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]}], "\[RightAngleBracket]"}], 
         "\[Proportional]", "|", 
         StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
         SuperscriptBox["|", 
          RowBox[{"-2", 
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "\[Phi]"]}]], "."}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\langle\\phi(x)\\phi(0)\\rangle \\propto |x|^{-2\\Delta_\\phi}.$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "00f6996d-b08e-0d4d-9b24-4b5579b7d866"],
 "\n\nEquivalently, its momentum-space form is\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["G", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["p", "TI"], ")"}], "\[Proportional]", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
            SuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["p", "TI"], "2"], ")"}], 
          RowBox[{"-1", "+", "\[Eta]", "/", "2"}]], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$G(p)\\propto(p^2)^{-1+\\eta/2}.$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "37bfab1c-3444-b741-a5ed-25079c68312f"],
 "\n\nThese imply\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "\[Phi]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["d", "TI"], "-", "2", "+", "\[Eta]"}], "2"], "."}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\Delta_\\phi=\\frac{d-2+\\eta}{2}.$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f82f9841-1b5b-1249-8bc7-2869b1f4c5f8"],
 "\n\nNow introduce the uniform source:\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["S", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["h", "TI"]], 
         RowBox[{"[", "\[Phi]", "]"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         StyleBox["S", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"[", "\[Phi]", "]"}], "-", "\[Integral]", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["d", "TI"]], 
         StyleBox["x", "TI"], " ", 
         StyleBox["h", "TI"], "\[Phi]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["x", "TI"], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$S_h[\\phi]=S[\\phi]-\\int d^dx\\,h\\phi(x).$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5bc68e27-042d-0c4a-b908-b16d23c0d9a1"],
 "\n\nSince the action is dimensionless, the source term requires\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", 
          StyleBox["h", "TI"]], "+", 
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "\[Phi]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         StyleBox["d", "TI"], "."}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\Delta_h+\\Delta_\\phi=d.$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c3333134-687e-ac4b-bb00-0f5ba7bdea7e"],
 "\n\nTherefore,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "\[Phi]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{
              StyleBox["d", "TI"], "-", "2", "+", "\[Eta]"}], "2"], ",    ", 
           SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", 
            StyleBox["h", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
           StyleBox["d", "TI"], "-", 
           SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "\[Phi]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{
              StyleBox["d", "TI"], "+", "2", "-", "\[Eta]"}], "2"], "."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "46"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ \\Delta_\\phi=\\frac{d-2+\\eta}{2}, \\qquad \
\\Delta_h=d-\\Delta_\\phi =\\frac{d+2-\\eta}{2}. } \\tag{B-46}$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e98c244a-1af9-4f47-8f77-ebb6db9f6c1b"],
 "\n\nHere these are critical scaling dimensions, rather than just \
engineering dimensions.\n\n2. Deriving the critical-isotherm exponent\n\nAt ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["T", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["c", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$T=T_c$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "905107e1-fba6-6d46-93e5-06d965a9d474"],
 ", define\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["h", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", "\[Phi]", "\[RightAngleBracket]"}], 
          StyleBox["h", "TI"]], "."}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$M(h)=\\langle\\phi\\rangle_h.$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a1b8e6c2-dc57-cf45-adcb-a952a57ca3e8"],
 "\n\nUnder a change of length scale by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["b", "TI"], ">", "1"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$b>1$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7c324090-4ae7-434d-81c2-b40d3021740d"],
 ", the critical equation of state obeys\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["h", "TI"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["b", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"-", 
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "\[Phi]"]}]], 
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["b", "TI"], 
              SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", 
               StyleBox["h", "TI"]]], 
             StyleBox["h", "TI"]}], ")"}], "."}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$M(h)=b^{-\\Delta_\\phi}M(b^{\\Delta_h}h).$",
      "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c76432d0-6d1f-4743-a15e-b8fb21d4ddac"],
 "\n\nChoose $b$ so that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["b", "TI"], 
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", 
           StyleBox["h", "TI"]]], "|", 
         StyleBox["h", "TI"], "|"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$b^{\\Delta_h}|h|$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "54897880-fcaf-3346-b837-f71e588087ac"],
 " is fixed. The remaining dependence on the magnitude of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["h", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$h$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ce7468da-0c4f-b141-9b4b-21ef2aa14173"],
 " is then\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["h", "TI"], ")"}], "\[Proportional]", 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["h", "TI"], ")"}], "|", 
         StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
         SuperscriptBox["|", 
          RowBox[{
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "\[Phi]"], "/", 
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", 
             StyleBox["h", "TI"]]}]], "."}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {},
      "input" -> 
     "$M(h)\\propto\\operatorname{sgn}(h) |h|^{\\Delta_\\phi/\\Delta_h}.$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "95c746df-749d-e943-8ac2-b7c43d9ff033"],
 "\n\nComparing with the definition\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["h", "TI"], ")"}], "\[Proportional]", 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["h", "TI"], ")"}], "|", 
         StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
         SuperscriptBox["|", 
          RowBox[{"1", "/", "\[Delta]"}]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {},
      "input" -> "$M(h)\\propto\\operatorname{sgn}(h)|h|^{1/\\delta}$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7b61fbff-5c2d-5a4a-9efd-f4a987880d65"],
 "\n\ngives\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
           FractionBox["1", "\[Delta]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
           FractionBox[
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "\[Phi]"], 
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", 
             StyleBox["h", "TI"]]], ",    ", "\[Delta]", "\[LongEqual]", 
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{
              StyleBox["d", "TI"], "+", "2", "-", "\[Eta]"}], 
            RowBox[{
              StyleBox["d", "TI"], "-", "2", "+", "\[Eta]"}]], "."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "47"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ \\frac1\\delta=\\frac{\\Delta_\\phi}{\\Delta_h}, \\qquad \
\\delta=\\frac{d+2-\\eta}{d-2+\\eta}. } \\tag{B-47}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "12195a4e-97a5-2b40-9f97-1ad3ffce00b9"],
 "\n\nThis uses fixed-point scaling of the singular response. It applies to \
the Wilson\[Dash]Fisher critical theory below four dimensions.\n\n3. The ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Epsilon]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\epsilon$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e900b4da-3cbb-124a-a3db-98bc4cdbe812"],
 "-expansion of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Delta]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\delta$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "33646f1d-4048-8745-b256-20a6a3cfc049"],
 "\n\nInsert ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["d", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "4", "-", "\[Epsilon]"}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$d=4-\\epsilon$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "44290e73-8c12-0040-bf20-2f28177ecc3c"],
 " and our result for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Eta]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\eta$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "02dbd7dc-cea0-b648-80b2-327a96d3d44d"],
 ":\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Delta]", "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{"6", "-", "\[Epsilon]", "-", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], "/", "54", "+", 
            StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
            RowBox[{"(", 
              SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], ")"}]}], 
          RowBox[{"2", "-", "\[Epsilon]", "+", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], "/", "54", "+", 
            StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
            RowBox[{"(", 
              SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], ")"}]}]], "."}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\delta = \\frac{6-\\epsilon-\\epsilon^2/54+O(\\epsilon^3)} \
{2-\\epsilon+\\epsilon^2/54+O(\\epsilon^3)}.$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ac65328e-a30f-6149-ac74-d4b853e0ac98"],
 "\n\nExpanding the ratio consistently through ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\epsilon^2$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "807ed28f-411e-a142-8514-2693cec2cdc3"],
 ",\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\[Delta]", "\[LongEqual]", "3", "+", "\[Epsilon]", "+", 
           FractionBox["25", "54"], 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], "+", 
           StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "3"], ")"}], "."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "48"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ \\delta =3+\\epsilon+\\frac{25}{54}\\epsilon^2 \
+O(\\epsilon^3). } \\tag{B-48}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f951c05e-677e-e143-a5c7-1b1d7228763a"],
 "\n\nOnly after this expansion do we set ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Epsilon]", "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$\\epsilon=1$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "759cf1e5-d88f-0f48-80ea-439fa79b4735"],
 ", giving\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
           SubsuperscriptBox["\[Eta]", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], 
            RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
                StyleBox["d", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "3"}], ")"}]], 
           "\[LongEqual]", 
           FractionBox["1", "54"], "\[TildeEqual]", "0.0185185", ",    ", 
           SubsuperscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
            SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], 
            RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
                StyleBox["d", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "3"}], ")"}]], 
           "\[LongEqual]", 
           FractionBox["241", "54"], "\[TildeEqual]", "4.462963."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "49"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ \\eta_{\\epsilon^2}^{(d=3)} =\\frac1{54}\\simeq0.0185185, \
\\qquad \\delta_{\\epsilon^2}^{(d=3)} =\\frac{241}{54}\\simeq4.462963. } \
\\tag{B-49}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4c7c4b0d-b094-834f-a25e-58cde8c4ab63"],
 "\n\nDo not instead substitute ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Epsilon]", "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$\\epsilon=1$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "fdc84ea7-be28-f441-82d4-d468b046ce8d"],
 " into the unexpanded ratio. That would retain uncontrolled higher-order \
terms generated by the denominator, rather than the requested truncated ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Epsilon]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\epsilon$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8b486059-6f5c-6b47-bc56-85e7892fa542"],
 "-expansion.\n\n4. Identifying the fluid variables\n\nFor the \
liquid\[Dash]gas transition, the order parameter is proportional, to leading \
order, to the density deviation:\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], "\[Proportional]", "\[Rho]", "-", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Rho]", 
          StyleBox["c", "TI"]], "."}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$M\\propto\\rho-\\rho_c.$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8b4d6ab6-05b5-7449-a0ff-5a245d44ba35"],
 "\n\nThe ordering field is naturally related to the chemical-potential \
deviation. To avoid confusing it with the DR scale ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Mu]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\mu$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bea5361c-c981-9246-b696-e9aa5fd78a86"],
 ", denote the chemical potential by $\\mu_{\\mathrm{chem}}$:\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["h", "TI"], "\[Proportional]", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Mu]", 
          StyleBox["chem", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "-", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Mu]", 
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["chem", FontSlant -> "Plain"], ",", 
            StyleBox["c", "TI"]}]], "."}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$h\\propto\\mu_{\\mathrm{chem}}-\\mu_{\\mathrm{chem},c}.$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "112f2ea0-9739-a041-abf5-594b62cf1fad"],
 "\n\nAt fixed temperature, the Gibbs\[Dash]Duhem relation gives\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["P", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         StyleBox["n", "TI"], "\[DifferentialD]", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Mu]", 
          StyleBox["chem", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], ","}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$dP=n\\,d\\mu_{\\mathrm{chem}},$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a8fa5c3c-a2ff-b341-9716-bced8fbc12ca"],
 "\n\nwhere ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$n$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "25d387ef-998d-4048-9f3a-e519ec62c9ba"],
 " is the number density. Near the critical point, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["n", "TI"], "\[Rule]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["c", "TI"]], "\[NotEqual]", "0"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$n\\to n_c\\ne0$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ef5f26a6-b111-2d47-8efe-2bd7f5162aab"],
 ", so along ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["T", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["c", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$T=T_c$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f6883851-2b61-3242-af21-383542383b94"],
 ",\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["P", "TI"], "-", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["P", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["c", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["n", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["c", "TI"]], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             SubscriptBox["\[Mu]", 
              StyleBox["chem", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "-", 
             SubscriptBox["\[Mu]", 
              RowBox[{
                StyleBox["chem", FontSlant -> "Plain"], ",", 
                StyleBox["c", "TI"]}]]}], ")"}], "+", "subleading terms", 
         "."}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$P-P_c =n_c(\\mu_{\\mathrm{chem}}-\\mu_{\\mathrm{chem},c}) \
+\\text{subleading terms}.$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3438015c-1481-244d-aed3-f73630c80ef9"],
 "\n\nThus, to leading order, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["h", "TI"], "\[Proportional]", 
         StyleBox["P", "TI"], "-", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["P", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["c", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$h\\propto P-P_c$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "540fa235-cefe-3744-88ea-d4bf58708117"],
 ".\n\nInverting the critical response ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], "\[Proportional]", 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["h", "TI"], ")"}], "|", 
         StyleBox["h", "TI"], 
         SuperscriptBox["|", 
          RowBox[{"1", "/", "\[Delta]"}]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {},
      "input" -> "$M\\propto\\operatorname{sgn}(h)|h|^{1/\\delta}$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "0cf5f061-5a46-724a-9ce6-a3a8a595acae"],
 ", and absorbing normalization constants into a nonuniversal amplitude ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["A", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$A$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b1d49915-ae39-d24c-9feb-75cd6f868024"],
 ", yields\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{
              StyleBox["P", "TI"], "-", 
              SubscriptBox[
               StyleBox["P", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["c", "TI"]]}], 
            SubscriptBox[
             StyleBox["P", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["c", "TI"]]], "\[Tilde]", 
           StyleBox["A", "TI"], " ", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["g", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "-", 
               SubscriptBox["\[Rho]", 
                StyleBox["c", "TI"]]}], ")"}], 
           SuperscriptBox[
            TemplateBox[{
              RowBox[{
                FractionBox[
                 RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "-", 
                   SubscriptBox["\[Rho]", 
                    StyleBox["c", "TI"]]}], 
                 SubscriptBox["\[Rho]", 
                  StyleBox["c", "TI"]]]}]}, "Abs"], "\[Delta]"], ",    ", 
           StyleBox["T", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["c", "TI"]], "."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "50"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ \\frac{P-P_c}{P_c} \\sim \
A\\,\\operatorname{sgn}(\\rho-\\rho_c) \
\\left|\\frac{\\rho-\\rho_c}{\\rho_c}\\right|^\\delta, \\qquad T=T_c. } \
\\tag{B-50}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1cb4213d-011d-d946-982f-fed1971fd193"],
 "\n\nReal fluids do not have an exact microscopic ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Phi]", "\[Rule]", "-", "\[Phi]"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$\\phi\\to-\\phi$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ad9fbd0c-e300-9f49-894b-4c6c041068da"],
 " symmetry. These identifications describe the leading critical scaling \
behavior; analytic field mixing and corrections to scaling can produce \
subleading asymmetries.\n\n5. Predicted scattering slope\n\nCritical density \
fluctuations have the same leading momentum dependence as the order-parameter \
two-point function:\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["S", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           StyleBox["q", "TI"], ")"}], "\[Proportional]", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["q", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"-2", "+", "\[Eta]"}]], ",    ", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Xi]", "-1"], "\[LessLess]", 
         StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[LessLess]", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["a", "TI"], "-1"], "."}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {},
      "input" -> 
     "$S(q)\\propto q^{-2+\\eta}, \\qquad \\xi^{-1}\\ll q\\ll a^{-1}.$", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8305572a-8e6d-bd4e-94f0-77205f9d2e3c"],
 "\n\nConsequently,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{
              StyleBox["d", "TI"], "ln", 
              StyleBox["S", "TI"], 
              RowBox[{"(", 
                StyleBox["q", "TI"], ")"}]}], 
            RowBox[{
              StyleBox["d", "TI"], "ln", 
              StyleBox["q", "TI"]}]], "\[LongEqual]", "-2", "+", "\[Eta]", 
           ",    ", 
           SubsuperscriptBox[
            RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"-2", "+", "\[Eta]"}], ")"}], 
            SuperscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", "2"], 
            RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{
                StyleBox["d", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "3"}], ")"}]], 
           "\[LongEqual]", "-2", "+", 
           FractionBox["1", "54"], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
           FractionBox["107", "54"], "\[TildeEqual]", "-1.981481."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "51"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ \\frac{d\\ln S(q)}{d\\ln q} =-2+\\eta, \\qquad \
(-2+\\eta)_{\\epsilon^2}^{(d=3)} =-2+\\frac1{54} =-\\frac{107}{54} \
\\simeq-1.981481. } \\tag{B-51}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "af8b1b4f-5fe7-0046-92f2-aa3289e8bafa"],
 "\n\nThe restrictions on ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["q", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$q$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8510521f-4ad4-8f48-938a-e11466df189f"],
 " exclude both the finite-correlation-length regime and microscopic \
molecular scales.\n\n6. Bootstrap and water comparison\n\nThe project \
supplies\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "\[Sigma]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         "0.518148806", 
         RowBox[{"(", "24", ")"}], ",    ", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
          StyleBox["water", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         "4.324."}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\Delta_\\sigma=0.518148806(24), \\qquad \
\\delta_{\\mathrm{water}}=4.324.$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8a0dc6ba-8ebd-f44d-bf79-b0173ccec649"],
 "\n\nFor the three-dimensional bootstrap benchmark,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox["\[Eta]", 
            StyleBox["B", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", "2", 
           SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "\[Sigma]"], "-", "1", ",    ", 
           SubscriptBox["\[Delta]", 
            StyleBox["B", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
           FractionBox["3", 
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "\[Sigma]"]], "-", "1", ",    ", 
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["s", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["B", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", "-2", "+", 
           SubscriptBox["\[Eta]", 
            StyleBox["B", "TI"]], "."}], 
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"], "-", "52"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\boxed{ \\eta_B=2\\Delta_\\sigma-1, \\qquad \
\\delta_B=\\frac3{\\Delta_\\sigma}-1, \\qquad s_B=-2+\\eta_B. } \\tag{B-52}$",
      "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "199cddd7-c666-3e40-a64a-0a9941368f40"],
 "\n\nThe water input supplies only $\\delta$, so we should not invent water \
values for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Eta]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\eta$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1952d385-deb3-1641-a10c-eef106ced077"],
 " or the scattering slope.\n\n",
 StyleBox["Mathematica comparison table",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\n\nThis cell computes the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Epsilon]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\epsilon$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2384e3d1-3b46-0a4e-8a7d-130783932fe1"],
 "-expansion first, evaluates it at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Epsilon]", "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$\\epsilon=1$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f7e11c20-00cd-c64c-b853-5010da88a7d1"],
 ", and constructs a table."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.004290587241661*^9, 4.0042909444707203`*^9}, {
  4.004290978798168*^9, 
  4.0042909918311768`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"09d8562f-7703-c748-9b00-\
a750fa7cb64d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Subsection", " ", "2.3"}], ":", 
    RowBox[{"expansion", " ", "and", " ", "numerical", " ", "comparison"}]}], 
   "*)"}], 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "eps", ",", "etaSeries", ",", "deltaSeries", ",", "eta3", ",", "delta3", 
      ",", "slope3", ",", "deltaSigma", ",", "etaB", ",", "deltaB", ",", 
      "slopeB", ",", "deltaWater", ",", "rows", ",", "comparisonTable"}], 
     "}"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"(*", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Expand", " ", "BEFORE", " ", "setting", " ", "eps"}], "=", 
      "1"}], "*)"}], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"etaSeries", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"eps", "^", "2"}], "/", "54"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"deltaSeries", "=", 
      RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Normal", "@", 
        RowBox[{"Series", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"6", "-", "eps", "-", "etaSeries"}], ")"}], "/", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"2", "-", "eps", "+", "etaSeries"}], ")"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"eps", ",", "0", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"eta3", "=", 
      RowBox[{"etaSeries", "/.", " ", 
       RowBox[{"eps", "->", "1"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"delta3", "=", 
      RowBox[{"deltaSeries", "/.", " ", 
       RowBox[{"eps", "->", "1"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"slope3", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "2"}], "+", "eta3"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", 
      RowBox[{
      "Exact", " ", "decimal", " ", "inputs", " ", "supplied", " ", "by", " ",
        "the", " ", "project"}], "*)"}], 
     RowBox[{"deltaSigma", "=", 
      RowBox[{"518148806", "/", 
       RowBox[{"10", "^", "9"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"deltaWater", "=", 
      RowBox[{"4324", "/", "1000"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"etaB", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"2", " ", "deltaSigma"}], "-", "1"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"deltaB", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"3", "/", "deltaSigma"}], "-", "1"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"slopeB", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "2"}], "+", "etaB"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"rows", "=", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Epsilon expansion through eps^2\>\"", ",", "eta3", ",", 
          "delta3", ",", "slope3"}], "}"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<3D Ising bootstrap\>\"", ",", "etaB", ",", "deltaB", ",",
           "slopeB"}], "}"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Water: Straub fit\>\"", ",", "\"\<\[LongDash]\>\"", ",",
           "deltaWater", ",", "\"\<\[LongDash]\>\""}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"comparisonTable", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
